+# Closed legacy Focus CPU source transition
+
+The native ExecutionProfile owner may retain the original public Focus profile
+04821eda only in an exact pre-1.9 native release series. The new private witness
+is not deserializable and does not grant model, lease, source-read, reservation
+or execution authority. Existing release/local-candidate and EvaluationOwner
